UID:event_313265617@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260615T051334Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260615T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260615T203000
SUMMARY:LBC Bike to 30K Program: Ride #13 Landis Valley Ride (17)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Grab your helmets\, bik
 es\, and sneakers — Lancaster Bicycle Club is gearing up for beginner an
 d transitional rides!** Local members of the LBC are thrilled to host this
  year’s **Bike to 30K Program**\, designed especially for new\, returnin
 g\, and curious cyclists.\n\n## **About the Program**\n\nBike to 30K is a 
 seven‑week series that gently builds your confidence\, fitness\, and mil
 eage. We begin with a five‑mile ride and gradually work up to eighteen m
 iles by the end of the program. Our goal is simple: to introduce riders of
  all experience levels to the joy of cycling in a supportive\, community
 ‑focused environment.\n\nThis program is **FREE** with an LBC membership
  — and membership is also free. The Bike to 30K program is open to every
 one in our community who wants to ride.\n\n## **Why We Ride**\n\nEver wond
 er why cyclists keep coming back? Because it’s fun. There’s nothing li
 ke coasting downhill and letting out a big “weeeeeee” all the way to t
 he bottom. But we also know that if you’re new to cycling\, jumping stra
 ight into an 18‑mile ride can feel intimidating. That’s exactly why Bi
 ke to 30K exists.\nEach week\, you’ll increase your mileage at a comfort
 able pace. You’ll get to know the club\, meet fellow riders\, and gradua
 lly grow into a confident **Fun Rider** — the group known for enjoying s
 cenic\, social rides together.\n\n## **Our Commitment to You**\n\nLancaste
 r Bicycle Club is dedicated to supporting new riders and helping our commu
 nity reach their cycling goals. Bike to 30K is part of our initiative to e
 ncourage more people to get outside\, get active\, and discover how enjoya
 ble cycling can be.\nSpend seven weeks with us and watch yourself transfor
 m into a Fun Rider — one mile at a time.\nThe Bike to 30K program is vol
 untary\, welcoming\, and designed with beginners in mind. We can’t wait 
 to ride with you.\n\n## **Membership\, Waiver & RSVP Requirements**\n\nTo 
 eliminate passing around a pen‑and‑paper waiver\, we require both:\n\n
 * **LBC Club Membership**\, and\n* **Meetup RSVP**\n\nYour RSVP allows us 
 to contact you after the ride if needed. Please note: **ONLY club members 
 who RSVP are covered by the club’s excess accident insurance policy.** B
 eing on Meetup does *not* mean you are a club member. To join our wonderfu
 l club\, please sign up through our membership link.\n\n## **Before You Ar
 rive**\n\nPlease plan to arrive **10–15 minutes before the ride** and en
 sure your bike is in good working condition. Helmets are mandatory. Please
  also bring:\n\n* 1–2 water bottles\n* A basic repair kit (spare tube\, 
 tire levers\, pump or CO₂ inflator)\n\nFor everyone’s safety\, **earbu
 ds and music are not allowed**.\n\n## **RSVP Required**\n\nYour RSVP is yo
 ur agreement to follow:\n\n* The club’s **Code of Conduct**\n* The **Rul
 es of the Road**\n* Our **Ride Waiver**\n\n## **Stay Connected**\n\nWe’v
 e gone social! Join us on Facebook: **https://www.facebook.com/B230K**\n\n
 ## **What to Bring**\n\nWater bottle • Bike • Helmet • Sneakers\n\nC
 ue Sheet to the Ride: [Ride #13 Landis Valley Ride ](https://routes.lancas
 terbikeclub.net/cue/lc-landis-valley-ride-18r/)\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\
 \*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*
 \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\
 *\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n***The Bike to 30K is brought to
  you by Lancaster Bicycle Club and Lancaster Trek Bikes.***
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3132656
 17/
