SUMMARY:CoffeeTue- SN Courtyard Cafe on Main (23R) C/D Pace-- RSVP require
 d
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: (volunteer t
 o lead!)\nRide Sweep: Lynn Pfeil\nCoffeeTue rides:\n• A rotating start l
 ocation\, not a school\n• A predetermined route\n• 25+/- mile routes\n
 • 12 to 14 and 14 to 17 mph average pace\n• “short” stop for refre
 shment/coffee mid-route at [Courtyard Cafe on Main](https://www.courtyardc
 afeonmain.com/)\n\nLike an All Class Ride\, CoffeeTue does not have a sing
 le pace.\nAs Sweep\, Rick Zook will bike with any "D" ride cyclist.\nThe C
 offeeTue rides are social rides\, but cyclists are not expected to stay in
  one group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable paces. A planned s
 top to regroup is recommended. Please be supportive of the other cyclists 
 to avoid anyone biking alone or being dropped off the back of the last gro
 up.\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nClick for [Ride with GP
 S](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/sn-courtyard-cafe-on-main-23r/
 )\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No ear buds. Please bring water and a basic re
 pair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate p
 assing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and 
 Meetup RSVP below to join this ride.\n\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you 
 are a club member. [Join here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.a
 spx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by
  the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content
 .aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) \,\n[Rules of the Road](
 https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=25714
 8&module_id=325159) \, and [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/doc
 s.ashx?id=454318)\nIn case of accident\, consult the [Ride Leader Guide](h
 ttps://s3.amazonaws.com/ClubExpressClubFiles/257148/documents/Ride_Leader_
 Guide_2026_123357428.pdf?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIA6MYUE6DNNJ6ROIH3&Expires=17782
 49903&response-content-disposition=inline%3B%20filename%3DRide_Leader_Guid
 e_2026.pdf&Signature=pwxGJ6nqlu4w9Zj8Kj%2Fl9U5%2BBtQ%3D).
