SUMMARY:Impromptu: WH Sundae Evening Social (19F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nWednesday Evening Road Ri
 de starting from Warwick HS. Join me as we preview a TdRR ride.\n\nAnticip
 ated Average Pace: 11-12 mph\n\nRide leader: Jon Hartung\nSweep: Volunteer
  to sweep\n\nRoute:\n[https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/wh-sundae-e
 vening-social-19f/](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/wh-sundae-eve
 ning-social-19f/)\n\nThe ride leader will ride at the advertised average s
 peed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main 
 goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group together with
  occasional regroupings and a sweeper may also be appointed at the start. 
 Please do not join this ride if you are not willing to ride with the group
 . If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and encou
 raged to join a faster group.\n\nIf maintaining a 11-12 mph average is bey
 ond your current ability level\, please consider joining a slower ride fir
 st.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic r
 epair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate 
 passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and
  Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you ar
 e a club member.\n\nJoin @ Lancasterbikeclub.net -Member Signup. Your RSVP
  is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: Code of Conduct
  Guidance if an incident occurs: Incident Actions
